+# Exact originals still needed
+
+1. **Port Authority/LMDC/SHPO:** actual inventory completed/furnished in October2004, its title, volumes, attachments, native database, covering transmission and recipient acknowledgment/accession. Obtain the earlier promised as-of-July1listing as a separately identified version, not an assumed equivalent.
+2. **LMDC/Howard+Revis/source-copy holders:** the expanded cross-country catalogue described in July2005, its contributor/source and object-ID crosswalk, version and delivery records. Test whether the later two-volume descriptions refer to this catalogue or another edition; do not assume either answer.
+3. **Port Authority/LMDC/SHPO/actual requesting consulting parties:** submitted copy, actual written requests, dispatched copies and edition/update history. A report of availability does not establish which recipient actually requested or received it. No private requester/contact details are needed in public notes.
+4. **Actual inventory/version holders:** October2004,2006andJanuary31,2007inventories and updates showing object identities, entries, additions, removals, coupon/whole-piece distinctions and transport/receipt. Different quantities cannot be subtracted as a missing-piece count without item-level equivalence.
+5. **Port Authority/LMDC/SHPO/agency-held contractor records:** June8,2006letter, Protection Procedure, Key Plan, actual approval, work logs, monitoring and condition reports. These distinguish plan, approval, execution and observed effect. No September2001act or specimen relationship is inferred.
+6. **SHPO and actual HABS/HAER repository:** August2005submission, accession/receipt, written history, photographs/keys/maps/drawing copies and amendments. Identify the actual repository and item before claiming it is available through the Library of Congress.
+7. **NIST/original yard and transfer custodians:** candidate-specific W14A/B, C12a/b and Sample1 intake/alias/photo/coupon/transfer/attribution records and DOC-NIST-2013-001311outcome. No new inventory has joined those candidates here.
+
+Underlying evidence could show documented delivery, ordinary updates and supported classification; it could instead expose material unexplained omissions or unsupported handling. Neither is selected in advance. Native and custody gaps remain requirements, not completed merely by recording this list. No contact, new request, fee or present access right is asserted.

